{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-hengeFalls-12331": "NIKOLAI: 这就……结束了？完事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-hengeFalls-12332": "ALEXANDRA: 墙好像在崩塌……可是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-hengeFalls-12333": "ALEXANDRA: 哇！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataCordeliaPit-12334": "AGATA: 你摔伤了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataCordeliaPit-12335": "CORDELIA: 没什么大碍。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataCordeliaPit-12336": "CORDELIA: 抱歉，事情跟我预想的不一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataCordeliaPit-12337": "AGATA: 魔法就是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataCordeliaPit-12338": "AGATA: 得找条路离开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaJunaPit-12339": "CORDELIA: 你没摔伤吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaJunaPit-12340": "JUNA: 没事，我身上肉厚，摔一下也不疼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaJunaPit-12341": "CORDELIA: 抱歉，我没料到会这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaJunaPit-12342": "JUNA: 要从这儿爬出去，可真得有两下子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraCordeliaPit-12343": "CORDELIA: 啊，亲爱的，真抱歉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraCordeliaPit-12344": "ALEXANDRA: 我设法让脚下的平台落得慢了些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraCordeliaPit-12345": "ALEXANDRA: 可它到底有多少是真实的，我也说不准。好像后来都化成雾了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraCordeliaPit-12346": "CORDELIA: 找条路上去吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaNikolaiPit-12347": "NIKOLAI: 受伤了吗？我尽力治。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaNikolaiPit-12348": "CORDELIA: 没有重伤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaNikolaiPit-12349": "CORDELIA: 只是受了点惊吓，没料到会这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaNikolaiPit-12350": "NIKOLAI: 我们可常遇到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaNikolaiPit-12351": "NIKOLAI: 附近肯定有上去的路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12352": "CORDELIA: 啊，我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12353": "BEN: 抱歉，最后一刻才看见你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12354": "CORDELIA: 事已至此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12355": "BEN: 好像看见一条还不太难走的路，能上去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12356": "BEN: 不过走之前……吃点零食？免得脾气又上来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12357": "BEN: 我有些芝麻蜜糖，还有半条面包。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenCordeliaPit-12358": "BEN: 不要？好，别说我没问。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaZikaronPit-12359": "CORDELIA: 你……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaZikaronPit-12360": "CORDELIA: 能感觉到疼吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaZikaronPit-12361": "CORDELIA: 你能悬浮，却不能飞。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaZikaronPit-12362": "CORDELIA: 要是知道你是如何造出来的就好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-CordeliaZikaronPit-12363": "CORDELIA: 一定有路上去。走吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12364": "BEN: 好吧，这可不是我盼的结果。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12365": "NIKOLAI: 现在到了大地的肚肠里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12366": "BEN: 仔细想想，这说法挺好笑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12367": "BEN: 毕竟，从肚肠里出来的……算什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12368": "NIKOLAI: 嘿嘿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12369": "NIKOLAI: 你在军队里肯定混得开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12370": "BEN: 除了跑步、开枪[oxfordComma /]还有听命令。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12371": "NIKOLAI: 尝过你的菜，他们连替你扑到手榴弹上都愿意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenNikolaiPit-12372": "NIKOLAI: 出去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJeromePit-12373": "BEN: 嘿，大个子，没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJeromePit-12374": "JEROME: 大致没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJeromePit-12375": "JEROME: 你飘下来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJeromePit-12376": "BEN: 像芭蕾舞演员一样优雅，大家都这么夸我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJeromePit-12377": "JEROME: 为了照顾我，得找条稍微寻常点的出路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12378": "BEN: 嘿，丫头，没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12379": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯，没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12380": "BEN: 太好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12381": "BEN: 你们城里好餐厅不少，我可不想因为没接住你，被人赶出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12382": "ALEXANDRA: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12383": "BEN: 放松，开玩笑的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraBenPit-12384": "BEN: 找条路上去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJunaPit-12385": "BEN: 哇！抱歉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJunaPit-12386": "BEN: 不过就刚才那一下，我敢说抱着你肯定特别舒服。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJunaPit-12387": "JUNA: 告诉你吧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJunaPit-12388": "JUNA: 确实。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJunaPit-12389": "BEN: 那好，给我预留点抱抱时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenJunaPit-12390": "BEN: 出去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenZikaronPit-12391": "BEN: 呼！这一跤够劲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenZikaronPit-12392": "BEN: 还好吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenZikaronPit-12393": "BEN: 要不咱们弄套……手势暗号？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenZikaronPit-12394": "BEN: 不行？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-BenZikaronPit-12395": "BEN: 好吧，找路出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataAlexandraPit-12396": "ALEXANDRA: 啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataAlexandraPit-12397": "AGATA: 没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataAlexandraPit-12398": "ALEXANDRA: 没事。常摔，或者昏过去，练得多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataAlexandraPit-12399": "AGATA: 几乎没擦破皮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataAlexandraPit-12400": "ALEXANDRA: 说了，我很擅长摔下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataAlexandraPit-12401": "AGATA: 找道能爬出去的岩缝吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12402": "ALEXANDRA: 结果还不算太糟……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12403": "ALEXANDRA: （哦！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12404": "JEROME: 你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12405": "ALEXANDRA: 哦……不知道，能过来看看吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12406": "ALEXANDRA: 不敢动，万一骨折或脱臼了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12407": "JEROME: 看着都没事。我扶你起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12408": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，谢谢，慢一点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12409": "ALEXANDRA: 谢谢。你有多高来着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraJeromePit-12410": "JEROME: 得找个地方爬出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraNikolaiPit-12411": "NIKOLAI: 丫头，没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraNikolaiPit-12412": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，嗯，没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraNikolaiPit-12413": "NIKOLAI: 好，够结实。个子小的都结实。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraNikolaiPit-12414": "ALEXANDRA: 什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraNikolaiPit-12415": "NIKOLAI: 字面意思，丫头，我又不是诗人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraNikolaiPit-12416": "NIKOLAI: 想办法爬出去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraZikaronPit-12417": "ALEXANDRA: 啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraZikaronPit-12418": "ALEXANDRA: 至少除了你，没人看到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraZikaronPit-12419": "ZIKARON: ……优雅……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraZikaronPit-12420": "ALEXANDRA: 现在倒会说话了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AlexandraZikaronPit-12421": "ALEXANDRA: 我要找路出去，你爱来不来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12422": "NIKOLAI: 都没弄清刚才怎么回事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12423": "JEROME: 这里的环境，并不像表面看起来那样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12424": "NIKOLAI: 为什么就不能一样？难道没几个吃五谷长大、务实稳重的法师？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12425": "NIKOLAI: 就没有普普通通的法师？不捻着胡子，也不穿那种藏着三十个暗兜的袍子？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12426": "JEROME: 哦，那种人其实最多。不过，他们喜欢六点吃晚饭，九点上床。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12427": "JEROME: 所以，你不会在这里碰见他们，更别说让他们来干这种事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeNikolaiPit-12428": "NIKOLAI: 赶紧离开这鬼地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12429": "NIKOLAI: 开什么玩笑……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12430": "NIKOLAI: 还好吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12431": "JUNA: 嗯，还好，没那么糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12432": "NIKOLAI: 得爬出去。你行吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12433": "JUNA: 最近练得不少。至少在尤鲁兽里算是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12434": "NIKOLAI: 比起跟我共事过的大多数士兵，你的心态好多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaNikolaiPit-12435": "NIKOLAI: 走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataNikolaiPit-12436": "NIKOLAI: 你没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataNikolaiPit-12437": "NIKOLAI: 我在说什么，你连靴子都没沾灰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataNikolaiPit-12438": "NIKOLAI: 你们到底怎么训练的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataNikolaiPit-12439": "AGATA: 重点是潜行、迅速出击，还有应付突发状况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataNikolaiPit-12440": "NIKOLAI: 练得不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataNikolaiPit-12441": "NIKOLAI: 想带路就请。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJeromePit-12442": "JEROME: 好吧……本来可以更顺利的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJeromePit-12443": "JEROME: 你们组织常做这种事吗？比如“修剪”元素灵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJeromePit-12444": "AGATA: 不常，而且只在人口聚集区附近。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJeromePit-12445": "AGATA: 这个生物，恐怕比我们见过的都古老。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJeromePit-12446": "JEROME: 那继续吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeJunaPit-12447": "JEROME: 受伤了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeJunaPit-12448": "JUNA: 没，挺好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeJunaPit-12449": "JEROME: 差点出大事，一下掉了两个治疗者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeJunaPit-12450": "JUNA: 我一直觉得，比起打架，自己更擅长谈情说爱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeJunaPit-12451": "JUNA: 可你知道，谁才真是个情种吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeJunaPit-12452": "JEROME: 我们该赶紧回去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeZikaronPit-12453": "JEROME: 哦，亲爱的神秘魔像。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeZikaronPit-12454": "JEROME: 你还完整。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeZikaronPit-12455": "JEROME: 虽然本来就是好几块拼的，可至少数量没错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeZikaronPit-12456": "JEROME: 那就走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJunaPit-12457": "JUNA: 呼！差点砸到你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJunaPit-12458": "AGATA: 太险了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJunaPit-12459": "AGATA: 完全没想到会这样收场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJunaPit-12460": "JUNA: 可不是闹着玩的。见过兽群狂奔吗？我们很少受惊，可一旦惊了……赶紧躲！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataJunaPit-12461": "AGATA: 走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaZikaronPit-12462": "JUNA: 呼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaZikaronPit-12463": "JUNA: 哦，你好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaZikaronPit-12464": "JUNA: 什么？不会，他们肯定没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaZikaronPit-12465": "JUNA: 哦，懂你的意思了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaZikaronPit-12466": "JUNA: 哈哈哈！确实有点像。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JunaZikaronPit-12467": "JUNA: 你总能逗笑我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataZikaronPit-12468": "AGATA: 没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-AgataZikaronPit-12469": "AGATA: 要是更多人能像你一样不抱怨就好了。"
}
